        <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
        <h3>Website Visitors</h3>
        <p>
          This static website ("PBSB") does not collect or store any personal information or track your browsing history, however some third party services
          are used to host, deliver and format the site content. These services are covered by the respective privacy policies of
          the data providers and service suppliers listed below.
        </p>
        <h4>Google Fonts</h4>
        <p>PBSB uses a Google Font to display headings on all web pages. Google uses your IP address to deliver the font file to you.
        <a href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy">Here</a>
         is an explanation of the process which goes into some detail. PBSB does not provide a way to opt out of this service.
        </p>
        <h4>CloudFlare</h4>
        <p>PBSB uses the CloudFlare content delivery network to provide cached versions of the Bootstrap UI javascript and
        stylesheets. These are used to format the web pages and help to standardize their appearance across different browsers and
        device types. Please see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">CloudFlare privacy policy</a> for more information.
        PBSB does not provide a way to opt out of this service.
        </p>
        <h4>Amazon Web Services</h4>
        <p>
        PBSB uses Amazon Web Services (AWS) to host and deliver all other website content.
        Please see <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/privacy/">AWS privacy policy</a> for more information. PBSB is not accessible
        without use of this service.</a>
        </p>
        <h3>Customers</h3>
        <p>
            If you make an inquiry to, or become a customer of Portraits by Simon Bland, we may capture some personal information
            in the course of business. This information is limited to the minimum amount required for business operations, such as: providing quotes,
             recording sales, and maintaining sales records for provenance.
        </p>
        <h4>Inquiries</h4>
        <p>
        Personal data for inquiries: email address (required), first and/or last name (if provided), any other information as provided
        </p>
        <p>
        The information you provide is used to create an email that is sent to us. Your name and email address are not stored
         on our web server and are not added to our marketing email list, but a copy of your email will be retained on our email servers.
         We will contact you via email only in reply to any inquiries
         you make.
        </p>
        <h4>Purchases and Commissions</h4>
        <p>
        Personal data: first and last name, billing and shipping address, email address, phone number, and order details/sales records.
        </p>
        <p>
        This information is kept with our store records and will be used by us to fulfil your order for goods or services. This information is
        not maintained on any public-facing devices or systems.
        </p>
        <p>
        We may use SquareUp to assist in invoicing and the secure processing of your payment information.
        Payments are handled by directly communicating between your devices's browser and the SquareUp Connect API.
        At no time is your credit card information either stored on our web server or visible to us.
        </p>
        <p>
        SquareUp's privacy policy is <a href="https://squareupapp.com/privacy/">here</a>.
        </p>
