        <h4>How Is Data Processed?</h4>
        <p>
        Data processing is carried out using both our cloud-based web servers and our personal computers. There may be occasions when some
        of your data may be accessible to third parties who have been appointed as Data Processors by us, for example we may use your
        address to look up your sales tax rate. A list of these parties may be requested from us at any time.
        </p>
        <h4>Where is Data Processed?</h4>
        <p>
        Your data is processed at our offices and in any other places where third parties involved with the processing are located.
        For further information, please contact us.
        </p>
        <h4>How Long is Data Kept?</h4>
        <p>
        Your data is not removed in the normal course of business; however we will remove and/or anonymize your data at any time
        on request.
        </p>
        <h4>Other Information</h4>
        <p>
        More details concerning the collection or processing of your data may be requested from us at any time. Please use the contact icon at the top of this page.
        </p>
        <p>
        You can contact us at any time to learn about the content and origin of any of your data, to verify its accuracy or to ask for
        it to be changed or deleted. All requests will be handled within 10 business days. Requests should be sent to us using the
        contact form on the website (if available), direct email, or Facebook Messenger.
        </p>
